# SokoYetu Stage 30A: Soft Launch and Final Handover

Stage 30A prepares SokoYetu for controlled soft launch.

## New page

```text
/admin-launch.html
```

## New endpoint

```text
GET /api/admin/launch-readiness
```

## Token

This page reuses:

```env
ADMIN_ORDER_TOKEN
```

## Soft launch meaning

Soft launch means the site can be tested with trusted users while admin closely monitors:

- Orders
- Payments
- Seller readiness
- Product quality
- Delivery handling
- Support requests
- Refund requests
- Data backups

## Not yet full public launch if

- M-PESA is still sandbox
- Email forwarding is not confirmed
- Sellers are not verified
- Product catalogue is incomplete
- Admin cannot manage orders
- Database backup/export process is not understood

